From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tfrecomp <tfrecomp@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 00:12:57 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 05/12] native: dxgi and d3d11 find their neighbours in their
 own directory

The native libraries name each other as @rpath/<name>.dylib and carried
only the rpaths of the build tree (@loader_path/../nativemetal, ...), so
the three files copied into one directory, for example Contents/Frameworks
of an app bundle, did not load without DYLD_LIBRARY_PATH or an rpath in
the host executable.  Add @loader_path to dxgi.dylib and d3d11.dylib
(winemetal.dylib has it already).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/d3d11/meson.build | 1 +
 src/dxgi/meson.build  | 1 +
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/d3d11/meson.build b/src/d3d11/meson.build
index 948db2a..352b6fc 100644
--- a/src/d3d11/meson.build
+++ b/src/d3d11/meson.build
@@ -56,6 +56,7 @@ d3d11_dll = shared_library('d3d11', d3d11_src, d3d10_src, d3d11_res,
   vs_module_defs      : 'd3d11.def',
   link_args           : d3d11_ld_args,
   link_depends        : [ d3d11_link_depends ],
+  build_rpath         : dxmt_crossbuild ? '' : '@loader_path',
 )
 
 d3d11_dep = declare_dependency(
diff --git a/src/dxgi/meson.build b/src/dxgi/meson.build
index acf8347..e966f00 100644
--- a/src/dxgi/meson.build
+++ b/src/dxgi/meson.build
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@ dxgi_dll = shared_library('dxgi', dxgi_src, dxgi_res,
   vs_module_defs      : 'dxgi.def',
   link_args           : dxgi_ld_args,
   link_depends        : [ dxgi_link_depends ],
+  build_rpath         : dxmt_crossbuild ? '' : '@loader_path',
 )
 
 dxgi_dep = declare_dependency(
